1. Vendor Management
2. Product Management
3. Purchase Requisition Management
4. Purchase Order Management
5. Inventory Management
6. Warehouse Management
7. Goods Receipt Management
8. Invoice & Payment Management
9. Approval Workflow
10. Contract Management
11. Reports & Analytics
12. Notification Service
13. Admin Module
Core Classes
Vendor, Product, PurchaseRequisition, PurchaseOrder, PurchaseItem, Inventory, Warehouse,
GoodsReceipt, Invoice, Payment, Contract, Approval, ProcurementService, ReportService
